{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0c99d192-5fac-8697-839d-911a53adcdcb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T10:41:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I got a pothole to report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where is it located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty Wellington Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty Wellington Avenue, got it. Is that right in front of your house, or is it a little way down the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out front. Mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, in front of number twenty. And how big would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, that's a decent size. Is it deep, do you know? Like, could it damage a tire?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it in the travel lane or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane. Near the crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Near the crosswalk. Is there anything going on with the crosswalk itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paint's faded. Cars don't stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The paint has faded and cars aren't stopping for people crossing. Okay, I'll note that too. Is that a spot where a lot of people walk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kids. My sister-in-law runs a daycare out of her living room. Down the block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:40:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so there are little ones crossing there. That's good for us to know. I'll put that in the notes so whoever looks at it sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:01-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So what I have is a pothole about two feet across in the travel lane in front of twenty Wellington Avenue, near the crosswalk, and the crosswalk paint is faded. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there anything else you'd like me to add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Add the street to the repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:27-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll ask that Wellington Avenue be added to the repair list. Do you want a call back once it's been looked at? I have a number here ending in oh-one-nine-oh, is that the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. That's the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Someone from the department will follow up. Thank you for calling, Mr. Cordero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T10:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
